00:17:15.321 --> 00:17:16.202
Saya akan menyemaknya.

00:17:16.202 --> 00:17:16.841
Mazhab Liuguang ialah

00:17:16.962 --> 00:17:18.202
mazhab terulung di dunia.

00:17:18.321 --> 00:17:19.642
Kami akan mencari penyelesaian.

00:17:21.561 --> 00:17:22.482
Tetapi jika

00:17:22.482 --> 00:17:23.962
ia benar,

00:17:23.962 --> 00:17:25.682
kenapa awak minta bantuan saya sebelum ini?

00:17:25.801 --> 00:17:27.202
Saya tidak mempunyai petunjuk sebelum ini,

00:17:27.402 --> 00:17:28.682
tetapi sekarang saya mempunyai preskripsi.

00:17:29.122 --> 00:17:29.841
Mencari penyelesaian

00:17:29.841 --> 00:17:31.321
hanyalah soal masa.

00:17:31.801 --> 00:17:32.761
Yakinlah.

00:17:36.081 --> 00:17:37.962
Nah, sudah sepuluh hari.

00:17:38.402 --> 00:17:39.601
Awak patut berangkat sekarang.

00:17:40.242 --> 00:17:41.882
Saya tahu.

00:17:42.122 --> 00:17:44.041
Saya akan pergi tidak lama lagi.

00:17:44.402 --> 00:17:46.281
Kemudian awak balik segera

00:17:46.521 --> 00:17:47.561
